# Console commands the webpage only sends with the admin password.
# Copy this file to blacklist.txt and set the password with: web admin
#
# One command per line. A line matches any command that starts with its words,
# so "gamerule keepInventory" blocks that rule but not other gamerules.
# Case, a leading /, and a namespace such as minecraft: are ignored.
# Anything after # is a comment.
stop
op
deop
ban
ban-ip
pardon
whitelist off
